        <!-- post -->
        <div id="post-858" class="post-858 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-craftsmanship">

          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/01/the-purpose-of-katas/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: The Purpose of Katas">The Purpose of Katas</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Jan</span>
            <span class="day">14</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/craftsmanship/" title="View all posts in Craftsmanship" rel="category tag">Craftsmanship</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/01/the-purpose-of-katas/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on The Purpose of Katas"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="858 http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/01/the-purpose-of-katas/">1 Comment</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

